I suggest you add "sign language" as either gloss or first place. The others 
aren't needed, as they're the same as those of "bangu", with the restriction 
to a sign language. You'll be presented with a list of English words 
that "sign language" resembles, in case you made a typo, and a checkbox to 
check.

